{"text":"kuruntokai","n":55,"lines":["மாக்கழி மணிப்பூக் கூம்பத் தூத்திரைப்","பொங்குபிதிர்த் துவலையொடு மங்குல் தைஇக்","கையற வந்த தைவரல் ஊதையொடு","இன்னா உறையுட் டாகும்","சின்னாட் டம்மவிச் சிறுநல் லூரே"],"tr":["mākkaḻi maṇippūk kūmpat tūttiraip","poṅkupitirt tuvalaiyoṭu maṅkul taiik","kaiyaṟa vanta taivaral ūtaiyoṭu","iṉṉā uṟaiyuṭ ṭākum","ciṉṉāṭ ṭammavic ciṟunal lūrē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"நெய்தற் கார்க்கியர்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Neytaṟ Kārkkiyar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 16, vañcicīr 2, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 4, oṉṟā vañcittaḷai 2, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மாக்கழி","tr":"mākkaḻi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாக்","tr":"māk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழி","tr":"kaḻi"}]},{"text":"மணிப்பூக்","tr":"maṇippūk","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணிப்","tr":"maṇip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூக்","tr":"pūk"}]},{"text":"கூம்பத்","tr":"kūmpat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூம்","tr":"kūm"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பத்","tr":"pat"}]},{"text":"தூத்திரைப்","tr":"tūttiraip","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூத்","tr":"tūt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரைப்","tr":"tiraip"}]}],[{"text":"பொங்குபிதிர்த்","tr":"poṅkupitirt","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொங்","tr":"poṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குபி","tr":"kupi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"திர்த்","tr":"tirt"}]},{"text":"துவலையொடு","tr":"tuvalaiyoṭu","foot":"puḷimāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துவ","tr":"tuva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யொடு","tr":"yoṭu"}]},{"text":"மங்குல்","tr":"maṅkul","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மங்","tr":"maṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குல்","tr":"kul"}]},{"text":"தைஇக்","tr":"taiik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இக்","tr":"ik"}]}],[{"text":"கையற","tr":"kaiyaṟa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யற","tr":"yaṟa"}]},{"text":"வந்த","tr":"vanta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"தைவரல்","tr":"taivaral","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரல்","tr":"varal"}]},{"text":"ஊதையொடு","tr":"ūtaiyoṭu","foot":"tēmāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊ","tr":"ū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யொடு","tr":"yoṭu"}]}],[{"text":"இன்னா","tr":"iṉṉā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]},{"text":"உறையுட்","tr":"uṟaiyuṭ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உறை","tr":"uṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யுட்","tr":"yuṭ"}]},{"text":"டாகும்","tr":"ṭākum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டா","tr":"ṭā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"சின்னாட்","tr":"ciṉṉāṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சின்","tr":"ciṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாட்","tr":"ṉāṭ"}]},{"text":"டம்மவிச்","tr":"ṭammavic","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டம்","tr":"ṭam"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மவிச்","tr":"mavic"}]},{"text":"சிறுநல்","tr":"ciṟunal","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"}]},{"text":"லூரே","tr":"lūrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லூ","tr":"lū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மாக்கழி","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"dark"},{"text":"கழி","lemma":"கழி","gloss":"backwater"}],"gloss":"dark backwater"},{"surface":"மணிப்பூ","parts":[{"text":"மணி","lemma":"மணி","gloss":"gem-like"},{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"gem-like flower"},{"surface":"கூம்ப","parts":[{"text":"கூம்ப","lemma":"கூம்பு","gloss":"to close"}],"gloss":"to close"},{"surface":"தூத்திரை","parts":[{"text":"தூ","lemma":"தூ","gloss":"pure"},{"text":"திரை","lemma":"திரை","gloss":"wave"}],"gloss":"pure wave"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொங்கு","parts":[{"text":"பொங்கு","lemma":"பொங்கு","gloss":"foaming"}],"gloss":"foaming"},{"surface":"பிதிர்","parts":[{"text":"பிதிர்","lemma":"பிதிர்","gloss":"spray"}],"gloss":"spray"},{"surface":"துவலையொடு","parts":[{"text":"துவலை","lemma":"துவலை","gloss":"drizzle"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the drizzle"},{"surface":"மங்குல்","parts":[{"text":"மங்குல்","lemma":"மங்குல்","gloss":"mist"}],"gloss":"mist"},{"surface":"தைஇ","parts":[{"text":"தைஇ","lemma":"தை","gloss":"having enveloped"}],"gloss":"having enveloped"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கையற","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"means"},{"text":"அற","lemma":"அறு","gloss":"to cease"}],"gloss":"helplessly"},{"surface":"வந்த","parts":[{"text":"வந்த","lemma":"வா","gloss":"that came"}],"gloss":"that came"},{"surface":"தைவரல்","parts":[{"text":"தைவரல்","lemma":"தைவரல்","gloss":"caressing"}],"gloss":"caressing"},{"surface":"ஊதையொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஊதை","lemma":"ஊதை","gloss":"cold wind"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the cold wind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னா","parts":[{"text":"இன்னா","lemma":"இன்னா","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உறையுட்","parts":[{"text":"உறையுட்","lemma":"உறையுட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டாகும்","parts":[{"text":"டாகும்","lemma":"டாகும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"சின்னாட்","parts":[{"text":"சின்னாட்","lemma":"சின்னாட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டம்மவிச்","parts":[{"text":"டம்மவிச்","lemma":"டம்மவிச்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுநல்","parts":[{"text":"சிறுநல்","lemma":"சிறுநல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"லூரே","parts":[{"text":"லூரே","lemma":"லூரே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"In the dark backwater, as the sapphire-like flowers close, the pure waves / with foaming spray and drizzle, along with the mist enveloping, / with the caressing cold wind that came causing helplessness, / an unpleasant dwelling it will become, / for a few days, alas, in this small, good town!","translation":"As the sapphire-blue flowers of the dark backwater close, the pure waves rise with foaming spray and drizzle. Enveloped by the mist and accompanied by the caressing cold wind that brings helplessness, staying in this small, good town will become highly unpleasant for a few days, alas!","modern":"கரிய கழியில் உள்ள நீல நிற மலர்கள் குவியுமாறு, தூய அலைகளின் பொங்குகின்ற நீர்த்துளிகளோடு பனிமூட்டமும் சூழ்ந்து கொள்கிறது. செயலற்றுப் போகுமாறு வீசுகின்ற குளிர்ந்த காற்றோடு சேர்ந்து, இந்தச் சிறிய நல்ல ஊரில் தங்கியிருப்பது இன்னும் சில நாட்களுக்குத் துன்பம் தருவதாக அமையும்.","explanation":"The friend speaks to the heroine (or within the hearing of the hero) during the onset of the cold season. She describes how the evening brings a cold wind, mist, and spray from the sea, causing the blue lily flowers in the backwater to close. This cold wind ('ūtai') is described as 'caressing' yet bringing a sense of helplessness ('kaiyaṟa') to those in separation. The friend laments that staying in this otherwise beautiful, small coastal town will become extremely painful for the next few days. Through these vivid images of the Neytal (coastal) landscape, she highlights the agony of separation and indirectly urges the hero to hasten the marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}